    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>What steadies you can be refracted toward someone else.</em></p><p>When you succeed on a <strong>defense check</strong>, you can choose one ally within <strong>6 squares</strong> who can see you.</p><ul><li>That ally rerolls the lowest die on the next defense check they make within the next <strong>minute</strong>.</li><li>They must use the advantage before the end of that minute, or it is lost.</li></ul><p>In fiction, this is you “sharing” a better path you just saw through danger.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"wlForesightSplit\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Split Beam</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> Trigger (defense success) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Free (after success) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">When you succeed on a defense check, an ally within 6 squares you can see reroll the lowest die on their next defense check within the next minute. Use it before the minute ends or it's lost.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
